  "$comment": "SUCCESS:ARC-0081 \u2014 typed permission vocabulary and evaluation semantics. decision_table outcomes are computed by evaluate_request, not authored.",
  "title": "Permission model: vocabulary, evaluation semantics and least-privilege statement",
  "unit_id": "ARC-0081",
